飞牛 r8169_mdio_register(内联进 rtl_init_one)在 phy_support_eee()
之后多了一句 tp->phydev->eee_cfg.eee_enabled = false(phy_device+0x4b1),
即支持 EEE 的芯片默认不开 EEE, 需要时用 ethtool --set-eee 打开。

来源: 飞牛私有(上游 6.18~7.3、ImmortalWrt/OpenWrt 补丁中均未找到)。
对比: rtl_init_one 1450/1450, 剩余差异只有 .LC 常量编号
(飞牛多一个 .rodata.cst2 常量)和 init_napi 中一处比较方向(cmovl/cmovg),
语义相同。

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/net/ethernet/realtek/r8169_main.c | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/ethernet/realtek/r8169_main.c b/drivers/net/ethernet/realtek/r8169_main.c
index 96378c1ce..6d35271dc 100644
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/realtek/r8169_main.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/realtek/r8169_main.c
@@ -6436,8 +6436,11 @@ static int r8169_mdio_register(struct rtl8169_private *tp)
 	}
 
 	tp->phydev->mac_managed_pm = true;
-	if (rtl_supports_eee(tp))
+	if (rtl_supports_eee(tp)) {
 		phy_support_eee(tp->phydev);
+		/* keep EEE disabled by default, it can be enabled via ethtool */
+		tp->phydev->eee_cfg.eee_enabled = false;
+	}
 	phy_support_asym_pause(tp->phydev);
 
 	/* mimic behavior of r8125/r8126 vendor drivers */
